{
  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "stem_md": "方程 $(2x+y-4)dx+(x+y-1)dy=0$ 的通解为（ ）",
  "options_json": [
    {
      "key": "opt_1",
      "content_md": "$(x+y)^4+2xy=C$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_2",
      "content_md": "$2x^2+2xy+y^2-8x-2y=C$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_3",
      "content_md": "$x^2+y^2-2x^2y+C=0$"
    },
    {
      "key": "opt_4",
      "content_md": "$x^3+y^3-2xy-y+C=0$"
    }
  ],
  "answer_json": {
    "option_keys": [
      "opt_2"
    ]
  },
  "analysis_md": "$\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac{2x+y-4}{x+y-1}$，设 $\\begin{cases}x=X+3\\\\y=Y-2\\end{cases}$ 得\n\n$\\frac{dY}{dX}=-\\frac{2X+Y}{X+Y}$，设 $\\frac{Y}{X}=u$，代入\n\n$\\frac{u+1}{u^2+2u+2}du=-\\frac{1}{X}dX$，积分得\n\n$\\int\\frac{u+1}{u^2+2u+2}du=\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{d(u+1)^2}{(u+1)^2+1}=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln((u+1)^2+1)$，\n\n得 $X^2(u^2+2u+2)=C$，即\n\n$Y^2+2XY+2X^2=C$，\n\n$2(x-3)^2+2(x-3)(y+2)+(y+2)^2=C$。",
  "search_text": "方程 $(2x+y-4)dx+(x+y-1)dy=0$ 的通解为（ ） $(x+y)^4+2xy=C$ $2x^2+2xy+y^2-8x-2y=C$ $x^2+y^2-2x^2y+C=0$ $x^3+y^3-2xy-y+C=0$ $\\frac{dy}{dx}=-\\frac{2x+y-4}{x+y-1}$，设 $\\begin{cases}x=X+3\\\\y=Y-2\\end{cases}$ 得\n\n$\\frac{dY}{dX}=-\\frac{2X+Y}{X+Y}$，设 $\\frac{Y}{X}=u$，代入\n\n$\\frac{u+1}{u^2+2u+2}du=-\\frac{1}{X}dX$，积分得\n\n$\\int\\frac{u+1}{u^2+2u+2}du=\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\frac{d(u+1)^2}{(u+1)^2+1}=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln((u+1)^2+1)$，\n\n得 $X^2(u^2+2u+2)=C$，即\n\n$Y^2+2XY+2X^2=C$，\n\n$2(x-3)^2+2(x-3)(y+2)+(y+2)^2=C$。",
  "sort_order": 13
}
